flowchart LR
  subgraph Android
    UI[Compose UI and ViewModel] --> BR[DashCueSyncBridge]
    MEDIA[MediaSession listener] --> BR
    NAV[Navigation and notification adapters] --> BR
    PREF[Preferences] --> BR
    BR --> ABLE[BLE central and protocol modules]
  end
  ABLE <-->|GATT RX/TX| PERIPH[ESP32 Bluedroid peripheral]
  PERIPH --> FRAG[Bounded reassembly and frame checks]
  FRAG --> PT[Protocol task]
  PT <--> Q[Bounded FreeRTOS queues]
  Q <--> STATE[Application state]
  STATE --> LVGL[LVGL UI/display HAL]
  TOUCH[Touch task/HAL] --> Q
  PERIPH --> AUDIO[Optional A2DP/audio HAL]
  ROUTE[User-configured OSRM/Nominatim] --> NAV
